  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 170, Number 83 (Tuesday, May 14, 2024)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. KRISHNAMOORTHI:\nH.R. 8385.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, Section 8, Clause I\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo amend the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act to\nensure the safety of food and limit the presence of\ncontaminants in infant and toddler food, and for other\npurposes.\n[Page H3204]\n</pre>",
